2026-09-15T12:01:37.4376124Z ##[group]Run kubectl create ns fission
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4376993Z kubectl create ns fission
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4377462Z make create-crds
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4378084Z # The kind-ci profile sets coverage.enabled=true on every leg, so
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4378914Z # every leg mounts the coverage hostPath (type: Directory, which
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4379769Z # requires the path to exist). Pre-create it on the node owned by the
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4380609Z # pod uid (10001), mode 0700 — not world-writable and never created
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4381429Z # root-owned by kubelet. Only the GOFLAGS leg builds instrumented
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4382300Z # binaries that write here; uninstrumented binaries ignore GOCOVERDIR
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4382986Z # and leave it empty.
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4383483Z docker exec kind-control-plane sh -c \
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4384428Z   'mkdir -p /fission-coverage && chown 10001:10001 /fission-coverage && chmod 0700 /fission-coverage'
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4385503Z # Multi-namespace tenancy: each leg exercises one of the three postures
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4396720Z # by composing a skaffold profile onto kind-ci, so every mode stays
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4397461Z # covered.
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4398046Z #   v1.32.11 → dynamic  (restart-free FissionTenant onboarding; the
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4398920Z #              serial TestDynamicTenantLifecycle onboards a fresh ns).
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4399758Z #   v1.36.1  → cluster  (trusted-cluster watch-all; the controller
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4400496Z #              auto-onboards every namespace; the serial
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4401256Z #              TestClusterTenantAutoOnboard runs a function in a fresh,
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4402082Z #              never-declared namespace and asserts fetcher RBAC stays
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4402752Z #              per-namespace).
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4403375Z #   v1.34.8  → static   (the all-legacy leg; RFC-0002/0013/0012 pinned
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4404184Z #              off below, so the static namespacing path is covered too).
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4404831Z PROFILE=kind-ci
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4405237Z case "v1.32.11" in
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4405735Z   v1.32.11) PROFILE=kind-ci,dynamic-tenancy ;;
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4406378Z   v1.36.1)  PROFILE=kind-ci,cluster-tenancy ;;
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4407127Z esac
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4407594Z SKAFFOLD_PROFILE="$PROFILE" make skaffold-deploy
2026-09-15T12:01:37.4496069Z shell: /usr/bin/bash -e {0}
