2026-09-15T12:08:05.4226932Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4227058Z NOTES:
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4227215Z 1. Install the client CLI.
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4227223Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4227340Z Mac:
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4228375Z   $ curl -Lo fission https://github.com/fission/fission/releases/download/v1.27.0/fission-v1.27.0-darwin-amd64 && chmod +x fission && sudo mv fission /usr/local/bin/
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4228383Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4228506Z Linux:
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4229480Z   $ curl -Lo fission https://github.com/fission/fission/releases/download/v1.27.0/fission-v1.27.0-linux-amd64 && chmod +x fission && sudo mv fission /usr/local/bin/
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4229487Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4229631Z Windows:
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4230783Z   For Windows, you can use the linux binary on WSL. Or you can download this windows executable: https://github.com/fission/fission/releases/download/v1.27.0/fission-v1.27.0-windows-amd64.exe
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4231011Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4231179Z 2. You're ready to use Fission!
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4231501Z   You can create fission resources in the namespace "default"
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4231508Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4231679Z   # Create an environment
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4232164Z   $ fission env create --name nodejs --image ghcr.io/fission/node-env --namespace default
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4232172Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4232332Z   # Get a hello world
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4232871Z   $ curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fission/examples/master/nodejs/hello.js > hello.js
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4232878Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4233097Z   # Register this function with Fission
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4233770Z   $ fission function create --name hello --env nodejs --code hello.js --namespace default
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4233781Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4233946Z   # Run this function
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4234267Z   $ fission function test --name hello --namespace default
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4234426Z   Hello, world!
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4234433Z 
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4234940Z   ⚠ Statestore embedded mode is enabled.
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4235373Z   Durability posture: all durable state lives on ONE PersistentVolumeClaim
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4235537Z   (statestore, 1Gi),
2026-09-15T12:08:05.4235939Z   owned by a SINGLE non-HA replica. This is for local and small deployments.
